        {
          "text": "Mukalu wabo wakadi ku Mahanayima, Bashana mujima, bukelenge buonso bua Oga, mukelenge wa Bashana, ne misoko yonso ya Yai, idi mu Bashana, misoko makumi asambombo: ",
