        {
          "text": "ne tshituha tshia Gilada ne Ashetalota ne Edelei; misoko ya mu bukelenge bua Oga mu Bashana yakadi ya Maki, muana wa Manashe, ya tshituha tshia bana ba Maki ku meku abo.",
